\node[below] at (Q) {$Q$};
\node[above] at (C) {$C$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
A $30^{\circ}$ angle, a $19$ cm side and a $14$ cm side give the two triangles shown.
What are **both** possible sizes of the angle opposite the $19$ cm side, to the nearest degree?

